<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SkyVayu | Scheduled Maintenance</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@600&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{

background:#08111f;
color:#fff;
font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
min-height:100vh;
overflow:hidden;

}

body::before{

content:"";
position:absolute;
inset:0;
background:url("aircraft.png") center center/cover no-repeat;
opacity:.08;
filter:blur(2px);

}

.container{

position:relative;
z-index:10;
max-width:700px;
padding:60px 40px;
text-align:center;

}

.logo{

font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
font-size:64px;
font-style:italic;
color:#f6b62e;
margin-bottom:15px;

}

h1{

font-size:36px;
margin-bottom:20px;

}

p{

font-size:18px;
line-height:1.8;
color:#d6d6d6;

}

.message{

margin:35px 0;

}

.status{

display:inline-block;
padding:12px 28px;
background:#1d4ed8;
border-radius:40px;
font-size:15px;
font-weight:600;

}

.footer{

margin-top:45px;
font-size:14px;
color:#8f96a3;

}

.loader{

margin:40px auto;
width:60px;
height:60px;
border:4px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
border-top:4px solid #f6b62e;
border-radius:50%;
animation:spin 1s linear infinite;

}

@keyframes spin{

100%{

transform:rotate(360deg);

}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<div class="logo">
SkyVayu
</div>

<div class="status">
Website Maintenance
</div>

<div class="loader"></div>

<h1>We'll Be Back Shortly</h1>

<div class="message">

<p>
We are currently performing scheduled maintenance and resolving a technical issue to improve your experience.
</p>

<br>

<p>
Our team is actively working to restore all services as quickly as possible.
</p>

<br>

<p>
We sincerely apologize for the inconvenience and appreciate your patience.
</p>

</div>

<div class="footer">

© 2026 SkyVayu Aviation<br><br>

Thank you for your understanding.

</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
